Z||000003||Oreif||08-24-2001||12:23 PM||||Just click on the links below. The first is so you can pre-register for the show on-line and the other will show all other info and a link to mapquest for directions.<BR>Registration for the show is free to NIFE members, and only $10.00 for non members.  The show is held in Oak Brook, IL, and lodging is available nearby at the Red Roof Inn in Downers Grove, IL.  For reservations, call (630) 963-4205.<P>Just click this link to register. <A HREF="http://home.xnet.com/~nife/ramareg.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.xnet.com/~nife/ramareg.html</A> <BR> <BR>Other info (directions to the show and raffle prizes) are listed at: <A HREF="http://home.xnet.com/~nife/" TARGET=_blank>http://home.xnet.com/~nife/</A> <BR> <P><BR>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-24-2001).]||||reg||1
