Z||000034||Oreif||08-28-2001||08:31 AM||||Hey don't forget to keep track of your mileage, There is a prize for distance driven to the show. You don't need to polish everything, it's a "daily driver" show so even a "work in progress" can (and have in the past) win. If anyone has any "interesting" Stories on their travels to the show, we have a prize for that too.<BR>Last year the guy who won it drove into the show with a flat tire. The tire went flat right outside the lot. It was a Ford car key that was stuck in the tire!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>I'll be there for the beers.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-28-2001).]||||reg||1
