Z||000038||Monkeyman||08-29-2001||06:07 PM||||So...Where's the beerfest gonna be?  I'm hoping to have dinner plans but something a little later (around 8ish?) sounds great.<P>Since no one else seemed to have thought of this, I'd better bring it up.  How about everyone showing up/registering at the same time and parking together at the show (if possible)?  I think that would be the best way for all of us forum members to meet.  Better than walking around trying to figure out who we are, right?  I'll be obvious if anyone looks at my plate (MNKY MAN), but some might not be as obvious.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
