Z||000051||Archie||09-02-2001||10:15 PM||||Ok All, it's only 6 days until the show. I see that a lot of people are coming in on Saturday before the show. <P>Whadda you say we find a Pizza Hut in Oak Brook, or that immediate area and have us a little Pizza Party on Saturday night for all the out of towners.<P>As long as I'm invited, I'll put in the First $100 towards the Pizza Pig Out. <P>Who is with me?... I figure the "locals" Host and pick up the bill and the Visitors pay for NOTHING.<P>Archie||||reg||1
