Z||000066||FieroMaster88||09-05-2001||04:14 PM||||WEll guess what everyone?!?!!?  I AM GOING!!!! I am so excited!  Cant wait.  <P>Hey Standard, I hope you come!  I want to see your coupe with the Quad in it!  I was thinkin about that swap in my car, but then did the V6....but you never know what I might do.  I love 4 cyl engines, and the Quad 4 is awesome!  <P>I cant wait to meet everyone there.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
Z||000067||jch82||09-05-2001||06:17 PM||||This is going to be great fun! I guess I will be there on Saturday night along with James, Ken and a few others. I'm not sure what hotel we are all staying at, but who cares as long as I see some fieros! Maybe I'll just sleep in my fiero..... <P>So what Pizza Hut is everyone going to be at??<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000068||Archie||09-05-2001||06:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jch82:<BR><B>So what Pizza Hut is everyone going to be at??<BR>Josh   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm glad you asked that.<P>Here is the deal. We will be meeting at 7:30 IL Time at Pizza Hut, 645 N. Cass Ave., Westmont, IL 60559. <P>The next question you may ask is "Where is that?" .... That would be an easy question to answer. The Show on Sunday is located at 2111 Midwest Road, Oak Brook, IL. I've spent the last couple of hours finding a Pizza Hut that was going to be easy to find. If you take Nidwest Road South from the show location 2.5 miles, You'll find the Pizza Hut just after Plaza Drive and before Ogden. You just need to follow Midwest Road South it changes names to Cass Ave. before you get to the Pizza Hut.<P>Once again, it is my intention that us locals will be "treating" the "out of towners" (visiters) who bring their Fieros & come to our FieroRama. I'll cover the first $100 and you other locals are up for the rest. <P>To cover our butts here, this is not an Official NIFE event nor is it an official "Archie" event. This is a BYOB event and the "Archie" will not be making any donations towards your picture of beer (if any).<P>Please, Don't drink and drive and if you do please plan on sueing someone besides NIFE or me.<P>Archie||||reg||1
Z||000069||Lady Pegasus||09-05-2001||09:34 PM||||Can't wait to see everybody.  87 and myself will be there, but don't look for the trademark Pegasus on the hood.  Mike got into a fender-bender and had to get it removed so the hood could be repainted.  But we'll be sure to have something out there so you will know the car.  Can't wait.  I'm sure all the N.I.F.E. members will walk right by the car.  It's so purty.  Looks BRAND NEW!!  YEAH!!<P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||10
